  {"id": "s13", "at": 24.45, "kind": "move", "refs": ["dave"], "key": "The bald plumber with the thick brown mustache takes a shower. The shower curtain hangs from a rod high above his head and hides his body from the chest down; only his bare shoulders and head show. Water runs down his bald head. A black smartphone strapped to his palm with silver duct tape lights up and rings.", "move": "water pours, steam rises, the strapped phone rings and lights up, he looks at it, his mouth stays closed", "seed": 8},
  {"id": "s14", "at": 25.7, "kind": "talk", "who": "dave", "refs": ["dave"], "key": "The bald plumber with the thick brown mustache in the shower, the shower curtain hides him from the chest down, only bare shoulders and head show, water running down his head. He holds a black smartphone strapped to his palm with silver duct tape to his ear and answers it with a cheerful shout.", "move": "he answers the phone cheerfully, shouting over the water"},
