  {"id": "s21", "at": 34.45, "kind": "move", "refs": ["dave"], "key": "Close-up: the bald plumber with the thick brown mustache in a dentist's chair, a metal mouth prop holding his mouth wide open; with his own bare hand he holds the black smartphone strapped to his palm with silver duct tape to his ear, eyebrows raised. From the right edge of the frame, the dentist's hand in a blue latex glove holds a dental drill.", "move": "his mouth stays stretched wide open in the metal mouth prop the whole time, he cannot close it; his eyebrows jump and his eyes roll as he tries to talk into the phone"},
